<title>TUNISIA: Tunisia CPI up 4.1 pct in first eight months.</title>
<headline>Tunisia CPI up 4.1 pct in first eight months.</headline>
<dateline>TUNIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tunisia's all-items consumer price index (CPI) rose 4.1 percent during the first eight months of 1996 compared to the same period in 1995, official figures showed.</p>
<p>The year-on-year rise for the first eight months of 1995 was 6.2 percent. The index has not changed in August compared to its level in July.</p>
<p>Tunis newsroom, 2161-787538</p>
</text>
